<v Yusuf Chaudhry>Hm. Churn?

00:01:14.933 --> 00:01:21.667
<v Desmond Mahlangu>Churn is up. Logo churn was 21 percent for the quarter. The biggest loss was fan tora.

00:01:21.867 --> 00:01:23.600
<v Oluwaseun Mwangi>Sorry, who?

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:28.067
<v Desmond Mahlangu>Vantorra Foods Group. The Brennock Falls account.

00:01:28.267 --> 00:01:30.133
<v Oluwaseun Mwangi>Right, right.

00:01:30.333 --> 00:01:37.667
<v Desmond Mahlangu>And our second-largest customer told us informally they're putting their renewal out to tender.

00:01:37.867 --> 00:01:41.200
<v Yusuf Chaudhry>That's concerning. What's it worth?

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:44.600
<v Desmond Mahlangu>Their ARR is three hundred thirty

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:46.067
<v Oluwaseun Mwangi>ouch

00:01:46.267 --> 00:01:50.000
<v Desmond Mahlangu>one thousand dollars so, yeah, not small.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:52.267
<v Yusuf Chaudhry>Okay. Headcount?

00:01:52.467 --> 00:01:58.600
<v Oluwaseun Mwangi>We're at 1,871 FTEs against a plan of one thousand eight hundred fifty eight.

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:02.800
<v Yusuf Chaudhry>And the hiring freeze holds through year end.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:17.400
<v Oluwaseun Mwangi>Yes. Also, for the record, we you know, wrote off $82 million from the old fennimore textiles dispute, and the auditors asked about the two million one hundred thousand dollars um, sitting in suspense.

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:30.867
<v Yusuf Chaudhry>Thank you, Nwachukwu. One more thing, I mean, and this stays in this room. the board has approved an across-the-board price increase that takes effect at the start of next fiscal year.

00:02:31.067 --> 00:02:34.600
<v Desmond Mahlangu>Oh. Okay. That helps the margin story.

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:39.467
